Native Windows developer harness for the unchanged production openmoss worker.
The reviewed pwilkin/openmoss and llama revisions are pinned in
third_party/openmoss-source-lock.json. LMA sources and harness are MIT.
Compatibility headers reuse the existing Windows parent-lifetime and stdio port;
they are never included in the Android executable or APK. No inference service,
virtualization, model weights, vocabulary or voice assets are bundled.
